# MagicEditor

- Follow root `AGENTS.md` as the source of truth for agent behavior.
- Architecture: `docs/magiceditor-architecture.md`.
- Standards: `docs/ai/coding-standards.md`.
- **Model routing (mandatory):** `docs/ai/model-routing.md`
  - Plan/Review → strongest (HIGH)
  - Build → default coding (MEDIUM)
  - Tests/lint/mechanical → fast (LOW)
- Skills catalog (load selectively): `docs/ai/skills-and-tools.md`.

## Hard rules
- `src/magiceditor/core/**` must not import PyQt6.
- Files >50MB: mmap + piece table + virtual viewport — never full `str` load.
- Prefer modules ≤300 LOC; one responsibility per file.
- After edits: VERIFY phase (LOW) — ruff + relevant pytest.
- AI commits need `Co-Authored-By` trailer.
